   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "混搭暖色与深色，可让客厅从白天的舒适空间转变为夜晚的神秘所在。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "00352281",
    "40343647",
    "s89257520"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/da/c4/dac41facf8c67a91577ea2a4b0b757b1.jpg"
